(42253, 448, 139, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  Great idea well executed.  It''s probably the perfect shutter speed for the shot, did you set it manually?</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  Great idea well executed.  It''s probably the perfect shutter speed for the shot, did you set it manually?', '2002-03-31 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
