(42274, 449, 441, '<td valign="top">spot on exposure - superb detail in your &amp;lt;150Kb file - good resizing - got to be a top-end cam?</td>', 'spot on exposure - superb detail in your &lt;150Kb file - good resizing - got to be a top-end cam?', '2002-03-29 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
