(42421, 465, 142, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors.</td>', 'Pretty colors.', '2002-03-25 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42422, 465, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems oversaturated or something.  Good angle though.</td>', 'Seems oversaturated or something.  Good angle though.', '2002-03-25 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42423, 465, 549, '<td valign="top">love the effect in the water and the purple lights.</td>', 'love the effect in the water and the purple lights.', '2002-03-26 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42424, 465, 689, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed ... might have considered taking this horizontally, since it was more of the bridge than the building. Reflection in the water is nice.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed ... might have considered taking this horizontally, since it was more of the bridge than the building. Reflection in the water is nice.', '2002-03-26 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42425, 465, 447, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!</td>', 'This is a great shot!', '2002-03-26 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42426, 465, 472, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2002-03-27 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42427, 465, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice composition I like the leading line of the bridge but the bridge looks blurred or out focus.The lighting under the bridge is very cool. Next time you might think about picking one of the objects and using that as the subject.  Personally I would have like to have seen a shot with the purple reflection or the flags on the bridge as the main subject. The leading line of the bridge is good but it gets cutoff by the little bridge tower. Perhaps less sky/buildings more river?</td>', 'Nice composition I like the leading line of the bridge but the bridge looks blurred or out focus.The lighting under the bridge is very cool. Next time you might think about picking one of the objects and using that as the subject.  Personally I would have like to have seen a shot with the purple reflection or the flags on the bridge as the main subject. The leading line of the bridge is good but it gets cutoff by the little bridge tower. Perhaps less sky/buildings more river?', '2002-03-27 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42428, 465, 361, '<td valign="top">Wow! I like this one!</td>', 'Wow! I like this one!', '2002-03-28 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42429, 465, 624, '<td valign="top">good city lights and theme, great contrasts</td>', 'good city lights and theme, great contrasts', '2002-03-28 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42430, 465, 441, '<td valign="top">Looks like really short exposure -according to flags.  Was this handheld? - would have benifitted with stable tripod.</td>', 'Looks like really short exposure -according to flags.  Was this handheld? - would have benifitted with stable tripod.', '2002-03-29 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42431, 465, 705, '<td valign="top">my eye''s drawn to the background buildings a lot for an image of a bridge; the light on the water and the girders is great, but the lights themselves are really hot.</td>', 'my eye''s drawn to the background buildings a lot for an image of a bridge; the light on the water and the girders is great, but the lights themselves are really hot.', '2002-03-31 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42432, 465, 725, '<td valign="top">excellent texture and depth</td>', 'excellent texture and depth', '2002-03-31 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42433, 467, 102, '<td valign="top">Feeling groovy....</td>', 'Feeling groovy....', '2002-03-25 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42434, 467, 203, '<td valign="top">feelin'' grovey</td>', 'feelin'' grovey', '2002-03-25 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42435, 467, 27, '<td valign="top">Would have voted higher had the framing been aligned to the subject.</td>', 'Would have voted higher had the framing been aligned to the subject.', '2002-03-25 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42436, 467, 346, '<td valign="top">This shot is halfway between being long shutter speed and having nice lights moev across the pic or stopping the action as it goes by. it isn''t strong enough either way.</td>', 'This shot is halfway between being long shutter speed and having nice lights moev across the pic or stopping the action as it goes by. it isn''t strong enough either way.', '2002-03-25 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42437, 467, 459, '<td valign="top">Added sharpness works well on lower left of photo.  Just an opinion, but I think the photo would be better if stoplight and streetlight were cropped out.</td>', 'Added sharpness works well on lower left of photo.  Just an opinion, but I think the photo would be better if stoplight and streetlight were cropped out.', '2002-03-25 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42438, 467, 1, '<td valign="top">Slightly over-exposed.</td>', 'Slightly over-exposed.', '2002-03-25 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42439, 467, 549, '<td valign="top">nice long exposure...nice colors</td>', 'nice long exposure...nice colors', '2002-03-26 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42440, 467, 325, '<td valign="top">Good job on the photo, this could have turned out mediocre but I think the composition is good.  Hard to avoid, but that light post across the top detracts from the photo. I like the way you captured the movement and the starring of the different lights. You might have angled the camera to use the blurring car lights as the leading line into the tunnel.</td>', 'Good job on the photo, this could have turned out mediocre but I think the composition is good.  Hard to avoid, but that light post across the top detracts from the photo. I like the way you captured the movement and the starring of the different lights. You might have angled the camera to use the blurring car lights as the leading line into the tunnel.', '2002-03-27 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42441, 467, 624, '<td valign="top">great coloring and imagination</td>', 'great coloring and imagination', '2002-03-28 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42442, 467, 441, '<td valign="top">lively shot</td>', 'lively shot', '2002-03-29 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42443, 467, 718, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2002-03-30 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42444, 467, 705, '<td valign="top">there''s a bridge here?  oh, I''m being sarcastic, but still...the bridge is lost in this image.</td>', 'there''s a bridge here?  oh, I''m being sarcastic, but still...the bridge is lost in this image.', '2002-03-31 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42445, 467, 725, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome picture</td>', 'this is an awesome picture', '2002-03-31 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42446, 467, 291, '<td valign="top">Just for clarification:<br/>The 59th St. bridge is that large 2 tier granite structure running left to right in the photo. The lighted underpass is used by vehicles on 1 st Ave. to go under the bridge.</td>', 'Just for clarification:The 59th St. bridge is that large 2 tier granite structure running left to right in the photo. The lighted underpass is used by vehicles on 1 st Ave. to go under the bridge.', '2002-04-01 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(42447, 467, 291, '<td valign="top">Thank You to those voters who suggested cropping out the traffic light, it makes a much better picture that way.</td>', 'Thank You to those voters who suggested cropping out the traffic light, it makes a much better picture that way.', '2002-04-01 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(42448, 469, 509, '<td valign="top">Kind of an eerie effect, not much light, but it sends a message</td>', 'Kind of an eerie effect, not much light, but it sends a message', '2002-03-25 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42449, 469, 346, '<td valign="top">simple, butmaybe not enough going on. I still like it though.</td>', 'simple, butmaybe not enough going on. I still like it though.', '2002-03-25 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
