(42520, 483, 325, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, beautiful photo. Good composition and the focus and exposure really bring out the colors and details. My only critique is that the building/horizon line is not straight, which detracts, but only upon closer inspection of the photo.  like the way the bottom and top of the building is nicely balance around the center of the picture without being in exact center of the photo. My eye follows the picture from the bottom to top and takes in the whole photo with effort at all. Good job.</td>', 'Very nicely done, beautiful photo. Good composition and the focus and exposure really bring out the colors and details. My only critique is that the building/horizon line is not straight, which detracts, but only upon closer inspection of the photo.  like the way the bottom and top of the building is nicely balance around the center of the picture without being in exact center of the photo. My eye follows the picture from the bottom to top and takes in the whole photo with effort at all. Good job.', '2002-03-29 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(42521, 483, 441, '<td valign="top">cracking shot - nice detail-good exposure.</td>', 'cracking shot - nice detail-good exposure.', '2002-03-29 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
