(42524, 483, 543, '<td valign="top">Thanks (except for you cretins with the 1 - 3 votes.  I can hear you whining now, "But the sky isn''t pitch black..."  Try photography sometime).  The rest of you are spot on w/r/t the straightness of the building.  There was a cab parked in the place I should have shot from, and the combination of perspective distortion from tilting the camera to get the whole bldg in frame and barrel distortion from using the wide end of the zoom made for some pretty funky verticals and horizontals.  Could be fixed in photoshop, but that''s not allowed.  Your comments are greatly appreciated.</td>', 'Thanks (except for you cretins with the 1 - 3 votes.  I can hear you whining now, "But the sky isn''t pitch black..."  Try photography sometime).  The rest of you are spot on w/r/t the straightness of the building.  There was a cab parked in the place I should have shot from, and the combination of perspective distortion from tilting the camera to get the whole bldg in frame and barrel distortion from using the wide end of the zoom made for some pretty funky verticals and horizontals.  Could be fixed in photoshop, but that''s not allowed.  Your comments are greatly appreciated.', '2002-04-01 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
