(42613, 492, 325, '<td valign="top">Good shot, strong composition. Good job on getting the low angle shot! The color is decent and like the lighting it is strange and unnatural, which adds to the photo. The only thing I can think of to improve is the focus, experiment with using the manual focus, set it at infinity and see what happens. You might also experiment with getting a leading line, through the picture.</td>', 'Good shot, strong composition. Good job on getting the low angle shot! The color is decent and like the lighting it is strange and unnatural, which adds to the photo. The only thing I can think of to improve is the focus, experiment with using the manual focus, set it at infinity and see what happens. You might also experiment with getting a leading line, through the picture.', '2002-03-25 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
