(42642, 494, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the way it leads your eye off the screen and leaves a suspenseful feeling about what''s really going on, good job on getting a low angle and I really like the lighting. Decent composition, but I think the framing would have been better if you had gotten more behind the shoes so that they were in the lower right corner and the footsteps were clearly seen in the upper right hand corner, it would have given the photo more depth and felt more complete that way, while still keeping that suspenseful feeling.</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the way it leads your eye off the screen and leaves a suspenseful feeling about what''s really going on, good job on getting a low angle and I really like the lighting. Decent composition, but I think the framing would have been better if you had gotten more behind the shoes so that they were in the lower right corner and the footsteps were clearly seen in the upper right hand corner, it would have given the photo more depth and felt more complete that way, while still keeping that suspenseful feeling.', '2002-03-26 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
